message: "If you use this software or its outputs, please cite it as below."
title: "TB financing shocks: replacement of US funding for tuberculosis in 2025, and spending per RR-TB patient, from data reported to WHO"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible, pre-registered analyses of tuberculosis financing reported by national programmes to the
  World Health Organization: how much of the 2024-2025 fall in USAID funding was offset by domestic,
  Global Fund and other funding, country by country; and how spending per patient treated for
  rifampicin-resistant TB changed between 2017 and 2024 relative to adoption of the 6-month BPaL/BPaLM
  regimen. Includes analysis plans committed before results, a pre-registered novelty search, and
  checks tying each manuscript's numbers to the code.
type: software
